[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ALLIANCE]
Trade Alliance

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ALLIANCE_desc]
The twins have firmly controlled Las Pegasus, but there is still a long way from a city to the whole world. It is event quite difficult to let their business empire control the entire Equestria nation: the twins may be able to gain some advantages in the negotiations with Cozy Glow, but they still cannot directly take over the entire Equestria nation.\nSo, let’s set a small goal first: integrate the Western Equestria. And what can be more attractive to ponies than trade and economic benefits?

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ALLIANCE]
贸易同盟

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_ALLIANCE_desc]
两兄弟已经牢牢控制住了洛马基，而从一座城市到整个世界还有这巨大的距离。即使是让商业帝国掌控整个小马国也是困难的——两兄弟也许能在与和煦的谈判中获得一些优势，但还没有把我可以直接接管整个小马国。\n于是，先定一个小目标：整合西小马国。而有什么比贸易和经济利益更能笼络小马们的心呢？

